WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:44.750
262 BC: the era of King Sho of Chin,
the dreaded "God of Battle."

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:48.040
The Kingdoms of Chin and Sho clashed

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:51.540
in the former Kan lands of Chouhei.

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:55.080
Their deciding battle was in Chouhei.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:58.000
Chin's commanding general was Haku Ki,

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.160
Sho's was Ren Pa.

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:04.000
But both kingdoms were
evenly matched in this great battle,

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.500
and it went on for two years
with no end in sight.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:17.660
Having run out of patience
with this stagnant situation,

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:21.120
the King of Sho made a most foolish decision,

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:23.000
replacing commanding general Ren Pa

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:26.950
with the hot-blooded young general Chou Katsu.

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:31.830
After two years of deadlock,
the floodgates opened wide.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:41.450
An ambush?!

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:43.870
So they've sniffed out our suicide force?

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:49.580
That's... the Chin army's lieutenant!

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:52.950
I am the Sho army
commanding general, Chou Katsu!

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:55.910
I have no business with a mere lieutenant!

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:13.040
Two years of intense war,
ruined--all because of you.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:16.290
May death give you a fresh start,

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:17.910
you silly man.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:26.140
"The Cursed Prince"

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.830
In the ninth month of 260 BC,

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:34.500
the opposing army under the defeated
commanding general Chou Katsu

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:38.580
raised the white flag, with some
400 thousand troops surrendering.

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:42.620
But here Haku Ki issued a fearsome command...

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:58.450
He ordered every last one
of the surrendering Sho troops

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:01.620
to be buried alive--

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:04.040
all 400 thousand of them!

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:13.290
How deep the sorrow and anger
of the families of those 400 thousand slain!

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:22.040
How intense the curses the
Sho people wished upon the Chin!

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:34.290
Some months after this atrocity,
a child of Chin royalty was born

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:38.410
in the Sho capital of Kantan.

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:46.950
That infant... was me.

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:51.500
My father--his name was Shi So at the time--

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:54.910
had been handed over to Sho as a hostage.

00:04:54.910 --> 00:05:00.410
And yet our King Sho was still
preparing for battle with Sho.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:06.830
No need to be surprised. That's politics.

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:09.000
But he survived...

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:12.580
Sho was planning to assassinate him, of course.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:17.870
But a man paid off the killer
and freed my father.

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:22.000
And did Your Highness return with him?

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.830
No...

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:27.620
My mother and I were left behind in Sho.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:34.580
Day has broken. We'll stop here.

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:52.080
Why is it...

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.950
...ever since seeing my mother the other day,

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.660
this old wound has been throbbing?

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:05.010
"Kantan, Capital of Sho"
"13 Years Earlier"

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:29.120
What possible good could come of you
marching along behind me all day?

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:31.160
How thoroughly aggravating!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.370
There you go again
with those creepy eyes of yours!

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:48.250
You little brat!

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:51.700
Someone's here.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.410
Don't just stand there!

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:02.250
Hey, lady.

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:07.830
You're <i>her</i> , aintcha?

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:28.410
Later. I'll be around.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:51.330
What's with that greedy look, huh?

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:55.250
If you want something to eat,
why don't you bow your head and ask for it?

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.080
Take that and begone!

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:10.870
Honestly, what kind of son would
put his own mother in this position?

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:13.250
Who'd ever take <i>you</i> for royalty?

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:20.040
I am not amused!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:53.410
What is it, Kou?

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:55.910
Your Highness seems tired.

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:57.200
Do you think so?

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:02.870
Yes. Usually Your Highness
reads so hungrily, but tonight...

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:05.250
Am I really that voracious?

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:11.250
N-No, Your Highness--
I-I didn't mean it like that...

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:14.540
I know. I was just teasing.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:23.000
Perhaps I could talk about her with you.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.330
About Shi Ka.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.120
Shi Ka?

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:30.870
You mentioned a Hika earlier.
Her name is actually Shi Ka.

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:34.660
What... What kind of person is she?

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:39.000
She was the head of Kantan's black marketeers

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:43.290
when I became indebted to her

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.910
for saving my life.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:49.940
"Ei Sei"

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:53.940
"Kantan, Kingdom of Sho"
"9 Years Earlier"

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:04.660
What do you mean, "under consideration"?!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.500
Dou Ken, my lord...

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.410
What's this "under consideration"?

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:16.870
Aren't you here in Kantan
because you've accepted the task?

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:21.700
No. We've come here to decide
whether we should accept.

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:24.660
So tell us the plan already.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:26.750
You black marketeers shouldn't press your luck.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:31.950
This plan is crucial to our kingdom--
we won't reveal it so readily.

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:35.410
And if we <i>do</i> decide to tell you...

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:38.250
...we'll have to kill you.

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:41.700
Now who's pressing his luck?

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:46.580
Don't you get it? This is Kantan, friend!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.500
The second anyone finds out you're from Chin,

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.500
you'll be torn to pieces
and thrown to the dogs.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:56.370
We haven't forgotten about Chouhei, you know.

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:04.660
Hey, now--enough kidding around, Kou Shou.

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:06.580
We're merchants.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:09.910
The only thing that gets us
hot under the collar is shop talk.

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:14.000
Long time no see! Lookin' good!

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.950
You too, A Mon!

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:17.330
C-Cut that out!

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:21.580
I am Shi Ka, leader of this group.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:24.790
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:28.290
This <i>is</i> shop talk. That's why
things were getting so heated!

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:31.040
All you can tell us is that
you want us to transport a <i>person</i> ,

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.160
and you expect us to go along with it?

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:38.000
These men are just being cautious
because the stakes are so high.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:41.410
Let me tell you what I know.

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:44.370
First of all...

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:47.660
King Sho died three days ago.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:52.450
Are you serious, Shi Ka?
The God of Battle finally di--ay-ay-ay...

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:54.250
Keep it down!

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:56.330
Woman, how did you...?

00:11:56.330 --> 00:12:01.200
Even among the Royal Court,
only a fraction know of the King's passing!

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:05.250
Rats know the way of rats, man of Chin.

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:09.540
And?

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.450
And Anko Kukun, the Crown Prince, will be King,

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:16.000
with the younger son, Shi So, becoming prince.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:20.290
Shi So... I've heard that name before...

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:24.660
Wait--isn't that the one who was
a hostage here for a dozen years?

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:28.910
The prince Ryo Fui put his whole
fortune into curryin' favor with?

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:32.080
Didn't he and a Sho woman...?

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:36.040
Yes, but even as Ryo Fui helped Shi So escape,

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:39.290
he could find no way for him
to flee with wife and child in tow,

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:42.410
and they were left here in Sho.

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:46.620
Hang on! Transportin' a person--
you don't mean...

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.370
Yes.

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:53.410
Just as that sly fox got Shi So
out of here seven years back,

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:57.620
the plan is to deliver his son,
Sei, back to the Kingdom of Chin.

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:04.660
Since you know so much already,
let's cut to the chase.

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:08.040
You must realize how serious this is.

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:10.830
And now, for you, there's no going ba--

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:13.080
Just a moment.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:16.910
We'll consider taking this on
once we've met Lord Sei.

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:19.080
First let me see him.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:21.450
What do you hope to gain?

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:26.790
It's only natural for a merchant
to check on the goods she carries.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:29.700
Only then will a decision be made.

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:33.330
Watch your mouth, woman!
The nerve of calling our royalty "goods"!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:38.750
Shaddup! Our commander is
doin' the askin', so just do it already!

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.160
After him!

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.660
Don't let him get away!

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:44.330
A little bandit, eh?

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:46.700
C'mere, everybody! It's <i>him</i> again!

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:47.700
It's Sei!

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:55.540
Damn brat!

00:13:58.410 --> 00:13:59.040
Kill 'im!

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:00.620
--Murder him!
--Aggravatin' snot!

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:02.410
--Damn brat stealin' food again!
--He's not goin' anywhere!

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:03.790
Beat him bloody!

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.290
Sei?

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:08.580
Not the same Sei
we were just talking about?!

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:12.200
Sure looks like a poor sneak thief to me!

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.290
Let me do it.

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:18.700
I lost my dad and my big brother in Chouhei!

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:22.040
Uh-oh--th-this can't be good...

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:29.450
<i>Now</i> you've done it!

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:31.250
Destroy him!

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:32.870
And they're off!

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:40.370
Hey, he ain't half bad!

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.290
Yesss! He's all ours!

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:49.160
Lemme at 'im!

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:51.540
Why, you...!

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:55.410
Wait! If you go,
you'll only rile them up even more.

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:57.620
But if this keeps up--

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:58.750
It's all right.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:03.830
They know the boy is a Chin hostage.
They don't dare take his life.

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:11.330
Enough! Rough him up, but don't
kill him--or they'll come for us!

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:14.580
Aw, come on!
This much ain't gonna kill him!

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:18.500
He's out cold. Leave him for now!

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:23.250
Then how 'bout we break his arm,
him bein' a thief and all?

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:35.000
Here goes!

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:38.370
Hold him steady, now...

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.370
Stop!

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:45.450
Not even a Chin would do what you're doing.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:57.000
Hey! Wait! At least thank
the lady! You Chin mongrel!

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:11.750
And don't come back!

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:14.660
What gives, nosy little lady?

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.700
Nothin' to gain from helpin' a lout like that.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:21.200
Those eyes of his aren't even human!

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:32.040
I think I got him figured out.

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:34.790
He's starvin'--I mean, really starvin'.

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:39.700
Since his father left seven years ago,
there's been no money from Chin.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:42.830
And since his mother gave birth
to royalty in an enemy land,

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:45.370
she's bein' treated just as badly.

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:49.790
Plus, with so little on the
job front, she wound up--

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.500
Sorry.

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:54.410
So what do we do now?

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:57.500
Well, we can't accept.
It's only a matter of time

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:00.500
before the King of Sho
hears about the King dying in Chin.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:05.830
And the first thing he'll do when he finds out

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.660
is murder Sei.

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:11.410
Probably.

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:14.370
If someone like him
becomes King of Chin one day,

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:16.660
he'll only end up hatin' Sho.

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:19.000
And once Sei's out of the picture,

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:22.540
all of Sho's gates will be shut tight.

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:26.660
Which means even <i>we</i> won't
be able to get out of here...

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:29.000
It's already a gamble
to try leaving the country

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.790
before the news reaches the King of Sho.

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:36.080
If we mess up, we'll be
tortured to death as traitors...

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:39.000
That's a chance I'm not willin' to take.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:42.950
Right. Okay with you, Shi Ka?

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:52.200
We can't accept this job.
Don't think badly of us.

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:55.750
And we won't breathe a word of this to anyone.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:58.620
Don't worry--we black marketeers
are tight-lipped.

00:17:58.620 --> 00:17:59.700
See you.

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:04.830
They're only Sho underground merchants...

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:05.830
Shall we slay them?

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:09.410
No. We can't afford
to stir up trouble right now.

00:18:09.410 --> 00:18:14.250
Hey, you! What happened
to your leader, that Shi Ka woman?

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:15.870
Good question.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:18.290
She just up and disappeared.

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:41.410
Do you hate the moon?

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:43.450
You're her--from before...

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:57.000
I used to hate it, once. The moon, that is.

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:59.750
The moon always seems
to shine even more beautifully

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:02.830
when you look up at it
from the depths of suffering.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:06.830
Almost as though it's laughing at you.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.410
"Don't give me that!"

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:13.330
That's how I used to gaze
at the moon, once upon a time.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:17.200
But then someone showed me
that wasn't how it was at all.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:21.660
My adopted father, a wandering peddler.

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:27.580
We--I mean, me and A Mon
and Kou Shou, from earlier--

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:33.120
my father saved us all
from the brink of starvation.

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:36.870
These are the words he left me with:

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:41.120
"The moon shines brighter than usual

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:45.370
to cheer you up--and onward."

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:12.330
I'm going out, Mother.

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:27.000
It's Sei! There he is again!

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:47.450
Hello?

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:50.330
I'm back... Mother.

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:59.040
More men...

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:03.580
Wait, Sei, my lord!

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:07.540
We have come for you!

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:11.370
We deeply regret your long years of suffering!

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:15.120
Lord Sei! The time has come to return to Chin!

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:17.120
You are going back to Chin!

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:22.620
To... Chin?

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:27.790
King Sho has passed away,
and your father has become the crown prince.

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:30.500
That means he will be the next King,

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:35.370
and after him, the next King will be <i>you</i> , Sei!

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:36.370
King?

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:41.160
Lord Sei?!

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:43.160
What is the matter, Lord Sei?

00:21:43.160 --> 00:21:45.700
Oh, no! Quickly, take him to the cart!

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:51.950
Those old fellas are plannin'
on doin' it themselves.

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:56.660
It won't work.
Those two can't even leave Kantan.

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:59.580
Hey, Shi Ka--they're headin' out!

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:02.580
What's up? You've been awful
quiet these past coupla days.

00:22:05.160 --> 00:22:07.620
Having second thoughts?

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:09.910
Not at all.

00:22:09.910 --> 00:22:11.910
Kou Shou, A Mon...

00:22:11.910 --> 00:22:15.750
Have you forgotten our adopted father?

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:19.790
Have you forgotten the hand
that rescued us from certain death?

00:22:19.790 --> 00:22:24.870
What's all this?
'Course we haven't forgotten, Shi Ka.

00:22:24.870 --> 00:22:26.830
Then you'll understand.

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:31.080
Standing before us now is one young boy.

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:37.290
A boy who will likely be killed
at once if no one offers him a hand.

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:41.910
What second thoughts could we have?

00:22:41.910 --> 00:22:46.910
Our choice is clear.

00:22:46.910 --> 00:22:51.370
Are you sure we can get him
out of here on our own, Dou Ken, sir?

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:55.660
We have no choice! There's no time
to revise the plan at this stage!

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:57.200
L-Lord Dou Ken!

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:05.700
You'll need some real preparation
to slip through the gates

00:23:05.700 --> 00:23:08.580
this late at night.

00:23:08.580 --> 00:23:10.370
It's you!

00:23:10.370 --> 00:23:13.620
We accept the job.

00:23:13.620 --> 00:23:16.790
By the name of black marketeer Shi Ka,

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:19.660
I will deliver Lord Sei to the Kingdom of Chin.

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.830
<i>Why would the voice that melted into the sky</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:59.450
<i>Peel away and disappear?</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>Just a single word</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.830
<i>If that's all you'd say</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.700
<i>What kind of word would you choose?</i>

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:15.910
<i>Holding my breath and making sure</i>

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:18.870
<i>The heartbeat can't wait</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:24.830
<i>If I let go of your hand, I'll want even more</i>

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:28.450
<i>And so I keep on doing this</i>

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.910
<i>Not allowing myself to stop</i>

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:35.700
<i>Because I'm still searching for answers</i>

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.370
<i>I want you to tell me</i>

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:46.200
<i>Before you melt away into the sky</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.010
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"Sei and Shi Ka"
